Statement of changes (Apache-2.0 section 4b)
================================================================================

Retrieved 2026-07-23. Modified 2026-07-25.

This directory began as the upstream `cloudflare-one` skill, whose SKILL.md was
a single 22KB document. It was restructured into a router plus references, and
the upstream `cloudflare-one-migrations` skill was folded in:

  - SKILL.md (22KB -> 3KB) now carries the frontmatter, retrieval guidance,
    workflow, a reference index, output defaults, and API safety rules. Its
    `description` was rewritten to cover the merged scope.

  - references/assessment.md   <- upstream SKILL.md "Assessment Prompts"
  - references/guardrails.md   <- upstream SKILL.md "Guardrails" (all subsections)
  - references/validation.md   <- upstream SKILL.md "Validation Prompts"

    These three are verbatim extracts. The only edit is the section heading,
    promoted from `##` to `#` so each file reads as a document in its own right.

  - references/migrations.md   <- the whole of the upstream
                                  `cloudflare-one-migrations` skill, unmodified
                                  apart from an added provenance header.

No upstream content was deleted or reworded. The pre-consolidation state is
preserved verbatim in this repository's git history at commit 42caf2b.
